Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,The people are queueing for a sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,人們正在排隊領取樣品。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:05.82,English,,0,0,0,,The woman is picking out some meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:05.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,女人正在挑選一些肉。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:09.18,English,,0,0,0,,The couple are shopping for groceries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:09.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,這對夫婦正在購買雜貨。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.58,0:00:12.91,English,,0,0,0,,The man is putting vegetables into the basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.58,0:00:12.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,那個男人正在把蔬菜放進籃子裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.31,0:00:16.22,English,,0,0,0,,What time should we arrive at the restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.31,0:00:16.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我們應該什麼時間到達餐廳？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:19.26,English,,0,0,0,,The schedule is quite full now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:19.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,現在日程已經排得很滿了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:22.54,English,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes before our reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:22.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,距離我們預訂的時間還有十分鐘。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:25.94,English,,0,0,0,,The table will be ready in just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:25.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,桌子一會兒就準備好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:31.71,English,,0,0,0,,Didn't the caterer say they would be here by three? It's already three thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:31.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,餐飲服務商不是說三點鐘就到了嗎？已經三點三十分了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.11,0:00:34.85,English,,0,0,0,,The entrees will be served shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.11,0:00:34.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,主菜很快就會上桌。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:37.94,English,,0,0,0,,They said they are stuck in traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:37.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他們說他們遇到了交通堵塞。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:41.60,English,,0,0,0,,I think they already finished serving everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我認為他們已經為所有人服務了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:46.68,English,,0,0,0,,Questions 41 to 43 refer to the following conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,問題41至43涉及以下對話。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:51.98,English,,0,0,0,,Thank you for calling Tino's Fine Dining. How may I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:51.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,感謝您致電 Tino's Fine Dining。我可以怎樣幫助您？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:57.22,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'd like to book a table for four at six o'clock tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:57.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,是的，我想訂一張明天晚上六點的四人餐桌。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:01:01.94,English,,0,0,0,,Not a problem. May I have your name, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:01:01.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,不是問題。請問您的名字嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.34,0:01:08.94,English,,0,0,0,,Jean Branson. We will need a highchair for one of the seats please as we will be bringing our toddler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.34,0:01:08.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,吉恩·布蘭森.我們需要為其中一個座位準備一把高腳椅，因為我們將帶著我們的小孩。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:15.56,English,,0,0,0,,Very good, I'll make sure they have the chair ready for you. Is there anything else you will need?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:15.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,很好，我會確保他們為您準備好椅子。您還需要什麼嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:21.02,English,,0,0,0,,One member of our party is vegan. Do you offer vegan dishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:21.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我們黨的一名成員是素食主義者。你們提供素食菜餚嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.42,0:01:27.30,English,,0,0,0,,We do offer several vegan dishes. I'll make sure to note it on your reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.42,0:01:27.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我們確實提供幾種純素菜餚。我一定會在您的預訂中註明。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.70,0:01:33.90,English,,0,0,0,,Excellent, thank you. Can you also please provide tableware and dishes for our child?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.70,0:01:33.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,太棒了，謝謝。您還可以為我們的孩子提供餐具和碗碟嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:44.14,English,,0,0,0,,It would be our pleasure. Just a reminder though, as your reservation is on the weekend there is a 90-minute limit for dining instead of the usual two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:44.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,這將是我們的榮幸。不過請注意，由於您的預訂是在周末，因此用餐時間有 90 分鐘限制，而不是通常的兩個小時。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.54,0:01:47.61,English,,0,0,0,,Why does the woman request a special chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.54,0:01:47.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,為什麼這位女士要一張特別的椅子？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.01,0:01:50.94,English,,0,0,0,,One person is physically disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.01,0:01:50.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,1人身體殘障。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:53.98,English,,0,0,0,,They will bring an elderly person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:53.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他們會帶來一位老人。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:57.45,English,,0,0,0,,One of the people requires back support.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:57.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,其中一人需要背部支撐。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.85,0:02:00.32,English,,0,0,0,,They will bring their young child.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.85,0:02:00.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他們會帶著年幼的孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:03.43,English,,0,0,0,,What concern does the woman mention?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:03.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,這位女士提到了什麼問題？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:06.95,English,,0,0,0,,A member of her group has a food allergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:06.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,她的小組中的一名成員對食物過敏。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.35,0:02:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,They might arrive late for their meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.35,0:02:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他們可能會遲到吃飯。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:13.54,English,,0,0,0,,One person requires a special menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:13.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,一個人需要一份特別的菜單。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:16.60,English,,0,0,0,,One of the group will arrive later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:16.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,其中一組稍後抵達。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:20.41,English,,0,0,0,,How much time will the group have to enjoy their meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:20.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,團隊需要多長時間享用餐點？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.81,0:02:22.46,English,,0,0,0,,One hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.81,0:02:22.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,一小時。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:24.69,English,,0,0,0,,Two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:24.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,兩個小時。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:26.86,English,,0,0,0,,Half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:26.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,半小時。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:29.54,English,,0,0,0,,One and a half hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:29.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,一個半小時​​。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:34.67,English,,0,0,0,,Questions 77 to 79 refer to the following message.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:34.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,問題 77 至 79 涉及以下訊息。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.07,0:02:42.27,English,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm calling about booking your services for a banquet being held after the Screen Actors Awards show next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.07,0:02:42.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,你好，我打電話來是想為下週演員獎頒獎典禮後舉行的宴會預訂你們的服務。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.67,0:02:48.70,English,,0,0,0,,I've heard good things about your catering company, so I was hoping you'd be able to accommodate our needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.67,0:02:48.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我聽說你們的餐飲公司不錯，所以我希望你們能夠滿足我們的需求。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:55.70,English,,0,0,0,,We will need a full five-course meal with appetizers, soup, salads, entrees, and desserts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:55.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我們需要一頓完整的五道菜餐，包括開胃菜、湯、沙拉、主菜和甜點。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.10,0:03:02.02,English,,0,0,0,,We have a confirmed guest list of 150 people, so it will be quite a large affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.10,0:03:02.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我們已經確定了 150 人的嘉賓名單，所以這將是一個相當大的活動。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.42,0:03:08.09,English,,0,0,0,,Several of the guests have a shellfish allergy, so they will need food free of all shellfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.42,0:03:08.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,有些客人對貝類過敏，因此他們需要不含任何貝類的食物。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.49,0:03:14.75,English,,0,0,0,,Additionally, there are several guests who are vegan, so they will require appropriate dishes as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.49,0:03:14.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,此外，有幾位客人是素食主義者，因此他們也需要適當的菜餚。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.15,0:03:20.26,English,,0,0,0,,Please get back to me within three days to let me know if you will be able to take the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.15,0:03:20.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,請在三天內回覆我，告知我您是否能夠接受這份工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:23.09,English,,0,0,0,,What is the purpose of the call?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:23.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,通話的目的是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:26.58,English,,0,0,0,,To cancel a booking for a banquet hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:26.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,取消宴會廳的預訂。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:30.03,English,,0,0,0,,To arrange for seating at an awards show.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:30.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,安排頒獎典禮的座位。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:33.29,English,,0,0,0,,To hire a caterer for a banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:33.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,聘請宴會承辦人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:36.42,English,,0,0,0,,To prepare a specialized menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:36.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,準備專門的菜單。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:39.66,English,,0,0,0,,What is mentioned about the attendees?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:39.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,關於與會者提到了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:42.74,English,,0,0,0,,They all enjoy eating red meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:42.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他們都喜歡吃紅肉。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:45.76,English,,0,0,0,,Some of them do not like seafood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他們中的一些人不喜歡海鮮。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:48.78,English,,0,0,0,,There are some with a food allergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:48.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,有些人有食物過敏。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:51.72,English,,0,0,0,,None of the guests are vegans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:51.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,沒有一個客人是素食主義者。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,What is the listener asked to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,聽眾被要求做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:57.78,English,,0,0,0,,Contact the speaker about the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:57.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,聯繫演講者了解該工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:00.74,English,,0,0,0,,Prepare some sample dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:00.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,準備一些樣品菜餚。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:04.12,English,,0,0,0,,Hire some extra servers for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:04.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,為這項工作僱用一些額外的伺服器。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:07.02,English,,0,0,0,,Find a replacement caterer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:07.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,尋找替代餐飲服務商。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.42,0:04:13.73,English,,0,0,0,,The head chef of the restaurant gets furious when the cooks do not follow his recipes completely to the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.42,0:04:13.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,當廚師沒有完全按照他的食譜做時，餐廳的主廚會勃然大怒。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.13,0:04:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,completely
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.13,0:04:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,完全地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:18.10,English,,0,0,0,,accordingly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:18.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,因此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:20.35,English,,0,0,0,,temporarily
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:20.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,暫時地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:22.70,English,,0,0,0,,automatically
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:22.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,自動地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:31.28,English,,0,0,0,,Customers with special dietary requirements are asked to notify the restaurant in advance so that dishes can be prepared to meet their needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,有特殊飲食需求的顧客請提前通知餐廳，以便準備滿足其需求的菜餚。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:33.50,English,,0,0,0,,voluntary
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:33.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,自願
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:35.70,English,,0,0,0,,monetary
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:35.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,貨幣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.10,0:04:38.07,English,,0,0,0,,complimentary
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.10,0:04:38.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,免費的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:40.25,English,,0,0,0,,dietary
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:40.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,飲食
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.65,0:04:43.67,English,,0,0,0,,Foodie Reviews – Pie in the Sky
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.65,0:04:43.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,美食家評論 – 天上的餡餅
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.07,0:04:46.69,English,,0,0,0,,Member: Nancy Dawson
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.07,0:04:46.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,成員：南希·道森
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:49.78,English,,0,0,0,,Very happy with Pie in the Sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:49.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,對天空中的餡餅非常滿意。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.18,0:04:56.13,English,,0,0,0,,I read about this restaurant on a blog I follow and since the writer said the food was fantastic,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.18,0:04:56.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我在我關注的部落格上讀到了關於這家餐廳的信息，因為作者說食物很棒，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:04:58.74,English,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:04:58.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我想我應該檢查一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:04.46,English,,0,0,0,,It's a bit of a drive to get to as it is located on Mt. Charles,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:04.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,由於它位於查爾斯山，所以需要開車一段時間才能到達，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:07.26,English,,0,0,0,,but it is well worth the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:07.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,但這趟旅行非常值得。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:15.85,English,,0,0,0,,There is a large open area in front of the restaurant that is perfect for taking pictures of the beautiful mountain scenery and for kids to play in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:15.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,餐廳前方有一大片空地，非常適合拍攝美麗的山景，也適合孩子們玩耍。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:21.62,English,,0,0,0,,After going in, we were greeted by a very courteous server who took us to our table.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:21.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,進去後，一位非常有禮貌的服務員迎接了我們，帶我們到了我們的桌子。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.02,0:05:27.90,English,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, they got the seating for our reservation wrong but quickly corrected the mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.02,0:05:27.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,不幸的是，他們把我們預訂的座位弄錯了，但很快就糾正了錯誤。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:32.98,English,,0,0,0,,They even gave us a window seat so we could look out on the mountains while we ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:32.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,他們甚至給了我們一個靠窗的座位，這樣我們就可以一邊吃飯一邊欣賞外面的山景。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.38,0:05:41.78,English,,0,0,0,,The head chef, who has won several awards, made sure our pizzas were cooked perfectly, especially the chicken one my children ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.38,0:05:41.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,曾經獲得多項獎項的主廚確保我們的披薩烹飪完美，尤其是我的孩子們點的雞肉披薩。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.18,0:05:44.80,English,,0,0,0,,The food itself was wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.18,0:05:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,食物本身很棒。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:52.71,English,,0,0,0,,To make up for the mistake with our reservation, they even gave us all a free dessert each, which was absolutely delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:52.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,為了彌補我們預訂的錯誤，他們甚至給了我們每人一份免費的甜點，絕對美味。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.11,0:05:58.58,English,,0,0,0,,I will definitely be returning to Pie in the Sky and recommending it to all of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.11,0:05:58.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,我一定會回到《天空之餡餅》並將其推薦給我所有的朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.98,0:06:01.22,English,,0,0,0,,Food 5 stars
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.98,0:06:01.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,食物 5 顆星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:03.90,English,,0,0,0,,Service 5 stars
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:03.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,服務5星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:06.65,English,,0,0,0,,Prices 4 stars
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:06.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,價格4星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:09.50,English,,0,0,0,,Atmosphere 5 stars
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:09.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,氣氛5顆星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:13.23,English,,0,0,0,,Why did Nancy decide to visit Pie in the Sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:13.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,南希為什麼決定去拜訪天上的派？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:16.22,English,,0,0,0,,She heard about it on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:16.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,她從新聞中聽說了這件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:19.98,English,,0,0,0,,She read about it on a blog saying it was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:19.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,她在部落格上讀到這件事，說這很好。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:23.02,English,,0,0,0,,Her friend recommended it to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:23.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,她的朋友向她推薦了它。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:26.21,English,,0,0,0,,She received a promotional coupon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:26.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,她收到了一張促銷優惠券。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.61,0:06:32.37,English,,0,0,0,,In the review, the word "courteous" in Line 5, Paragraph 1 is closest in meaning to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.61,0:06:32.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,在評論中，第 5 行第 1 段中的「禮貌」一詞的含義最接近？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:34.38,English,,0,0,0,,polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:34.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,有禮貌的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:36.58,English,,0,0,0,,professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:36.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,專業的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,passionate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,熱情的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.08,0:06:40.69,English,,0,0,0,,patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.08,0:06:40.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,病人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:45.46,English,,0,0,0,,According to the review, what issue did Nancy have at the restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:45.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,根據評論，Nancy 在餐廳遇到了什麼問題？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,The food was not cooked properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,食物沒有煮熟。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:51.75,English,,0,0,0,,She was overcharged for her meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:51.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,她的餐費被多收了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.15,0:06:54.55,English,,0,0,0,,The servers were rude to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.15,0:06:54.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,服務生對她很粗魯。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.95,0:06:57.74,English,,0,0,0,,Her reservation was not correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.95,0:06:57.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,她的預訂不正確。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:07:01.02,English,,0,0,0,,What is NOT mentioned about the restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:07:01.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,關於餐廳沒有提到什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:03.79,English,,0,0,0,,The food tastes great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:03.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,食物味道好極了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.19,0:07:06.54,English,,0,0,0,,The prices are reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.19,0:07:06.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,價格合理。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.94,0:07:09.34,English,,0,0,0,,The scenery is enjoyable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.94,0:07:09.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,景色令人賞心悅目。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:12.91,English,,0,0,0,,The head chef has won multiple awards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:12.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,主廚曾榮獲多項獎項。